9	/**
10	 * Rejects a create request whose E.164 telephone is already used by another owner, so the
11	 * pair maps to a 409. Runs after {@link NormalizeOwnerTelephone} has canonicalized the
12	 * request's telephone to E.164, and before {@link BuildOwner} maps it to an entity. Existing
13	 * owners are compared on their E.164 telephone too, so formatting differences do not hide a
14	 * collision.
